# cli/

Defines and registers CLI commands for Riffle. The configurator is the single entry point for declaring all available commands and their metadata to the CLI framework.

## Dirs

- `commands/` -- command implementations (Sia, SiaRun, SiaPipelines)

## Files

- `configurator.ex` -- command registry; registers commands with Arca CLI framework
